body:
This is a very complex case. The annotations were propagated from neighboring nodes from this huge family since all others seem to have a similar function within this family (**PTHR23147**). There was no relevant primary annotation for  node **PTN001924395** since the **MDR1_YEAST** sequence which has the right annotations is absent from this node and is miss-localized in another family: **PTHR23003**.
I wonder if we shouldn't create a separate family with PTN001924395 and move MDR1_YEAST to it
@huaiyumi ?
